641	//
642	// on AVX, this would be:
643	//     _mm256_testz_si256(x, x)     -- packed bit test, set zero flag (ZF)
644	//                                  -- AND two values; AND(X, X) <=> is 0?
645	// mnemonic, which compiles to VPTEST.
646	//
647	// temporarily, we just compare input vector to an all-zeroes known SIMD vector
648	//
649	// TODO: find portable C which compiles into ISA-specific VPTEST or equivalent
650	// TODO: document that we depend on a known binary representation
651	//
652	// 0 -> does not divide
653	//   -> trialdiv() functions return >0 if candidate may be prime
654	//                                  0  if at least one small prime divides
655	
